%% Diagram: Independent Review Workflow
%% ID: HARNESS-D20 | Version: 0.1 | State: Target proposal; review integration not implemented
flowchart LR
  implementer["Implementer completes scoped change"] --> evidence["Diff, acceptance checks and command outputs"]
  evidence --> reviewer["Independent read-only reviewer"]
  reviewer --> findings["Findings with severity and file evidence"]
  findings --> decision{"Blocking finding?"}
  decision -->|Yes| fix["Implementer addresses finding"] --> checks["Rerun affected checks"] --> reviewer
  decision -->|No| owner["Owner accepts reviewed result"]
  owner --> record["Record decision and remaining risks"]
